    </div><!-- </hs:element194> --><!-- <hs:element76> --><div id="element76" style="position: absolute; top: 2199px; left: 405px; width: 290px; height: 91px; z-index: 14;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size10 Helvetica10"><b>This website is administered by:</b><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>Richard F. Ward   </b></font><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b><a target="_blank" href="http://neweastside.homestead.com/resume.html">(resume) </a></b><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>155 N. Harbor Dr. #5101, Chicago, Illinois 60601</b><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>Phone Link or Locater 312-473-7931</b><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>Email:</b></font><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b><a target="_blank" href="mailto:neweastside@gmail.com"> neweastside@gmail.com</a></b><br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element76> --><!-- <hs:element113> --><div id="element113" style="position: absolute; top: 1828px; left: 454px; width: 177px; height: 128px; z-index: 15;"><div id="element113outer"><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_topleft"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_topright"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_bottomleft"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_bottomright"></div><div id="element113horiz"></div><div id="element113vert"></div></div></div><!-- </hs:element113> --><!-- <hs:element77> --><div id="element77" style="position: absolute; top: 1475px; left: 645px; width: 313px; height: 16px; z-index: 16;"><font style="display:block" face="'Times New Roman', Times, serif" class="size11 TimesRoman11" color="#000000"><b><i>This page was last updated on: October 2, 2023</i></b></font></div><!-- </hs:element77> --><!-- <hs:element121> --><div id="element121" style="position: absolute; top: 2191px; left: 755px; width: 289px; height: 78px; z-index: 17;"><div id="element121outer"><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_topleft"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_topright"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_bottomleft"></div><div class="corner_BEC4FD_15_bottomright"></div><div id="element121horiz"></div><div id="element121vert"></div></div></div><!-- </hs:element121> --><!-- <hs:element81> --><div id="element81" style="position: absolute; top: 62px; left: 18px; width: 653px; height: 52px; z-index: 18;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#FFFFFF" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>This website was created in 1999 as a forum for the 17,000 RESIDENTS that currently reside in the NEW EASTSIDE area of Chicago. We live north of Grant Park to the Chicago River, and east of Michigan Ave to Lake Michigan.  </b><br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element81> --><!-- <hs:element82> --><div id="element82" style="position: absolute; top: 781px; left: 799px; width: 177px; height: 176px; z-index: 19;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size10 Helvetica10"><b>Homepage Visits  since May, 2000.  During December, 2018, this counter rolled over at 99,999.  There are now over 225 webpages on this New Eastside Community website. </b><br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element82> --><!-- <hs:element84> --><div id="element84" style="position: absolute; top: 2010px; left: 403px; width: 285px; height: 152px; z-index: 20;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>Your suggestions, ideas, comments, complaints of neighborhood problems will be investigated without relating your identification (unless you give us your permission).</b><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size9 Helvetica9"><b>EVERYONE is free to use any graphic or picture on this website for non-commercial purposes only.  Just right-click, copy and paste, or print.</b><br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element84> --><!-- <hs:element86> --><div id="element86" style="position: absolute; top: 1099px; left: 472px; width: 188px; height: 20px; z-index: 21;"><map name="MAP_15256361"><area target="_parent" shape="rect" coords="0,0,99,20" title="Submit" alt="Sign In" href="/~site/Scripts_NewGuest/NewGuest.dll?CMD=CMDGetSubmitForm&amp;STYLE=plaintext/&amp;FORWARDFLAG=true&amp;GBID=15256361&amp;DISPLAY=17&amp;TARGETURL=DEFAULT&amp;EMAILADDRESS=ENC__e33081551dcf91b33da016e8d7a4218361696c2e636f6d&amp;EM=true&amp;CUSTOMVALUE=Your%20building%20number&amp;H_H=3979612"><area target="_parent" shape="rect" coords="110,0,188,20" title="View Entries" alt="View Entries" href="/~site/Scripts_NewGuest/NewGuest.dll?CMD=CMDGetViewEntriesPage&amp;STYLE=plaintext/&amp;ENTRYID=&amp;FORWARDFLAG=true&amp;GBID=15256361&amp;DISPLAY=17&amp;TARGETURL=DEFAULT&amp;EMAILADDRESS=ENC__e33081551dcf91b33da016e8d7a4218361696c2e636f6d&amp;EM=true&amp;CUSTOMVALUE=Your%20building%20number&amp;H_H=3979612"><area shape="default" nohref alt=""></map><img height="20" width="188" border="0" usemap="#MAP_15256361" alt="" src="/~site/tool/Homestead/HC_Objects/Images/HCUser_Guestbook/plaintext/guestbook.gif"></div><!-- </hs:element86> --><!-- <hs:element87> --><div id="element87" style="position: absolute; top: 314px; left: 811px; width: 147px; height: 240px; z-index: 22;"><div style="overflow: hidden; height: 240px; width: 147px; border: 0px solid #52A8EC; border-radius: 0px; box-shadow: none;"><img height="240" width="147" style="display: block; border-radius: 0px;" title="" alt="" src="files/neweastsidesign60.jpg" /></div></div><!-- </hs:element87> --><!-- <hs:element88> --><div id="element88" style="position: absolute; top: 560px; left: 823px; width: 128px; height: 20px; z-index: 23;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size12 Helvetica12"><b>Since the 1980&#39;s</b><br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element88> --><!-- <hs:element90> --><div id="element90" style="position: absolute; top: 587px; left: 787px; width: 195px; height: 182px; z-index: 24;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;" align="left"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" color="#000000" class="size8 Helvetica8">This sign is located just north of Randolph on Harbor Drive. The &quot;New Eastside&quot; name was used as early as 1980  We are attempting to &quot;preserve our historic name&quot; by having the city&#39;s sign department replace the signs that have been lost over the years. There are currently nine remaining signs in the New Eastside area.<br></font></div></div><!-- </hs:element90> --><!-- <hs:element92> --><div id="element92" style="position: absolute; top: 988px; left: 841px; width: 95px; height: 43px; z-index: 25;"><a target="_top" href="/~site/Scripts_ElementMailer/elementMailer.dll?CMD=CMDTellAFriend&amp;PageURL=Referer_Redirect&amp;HomesteadBase=www.homestead-dev.com"><img height="43" width="95" style="display:block" border="0" alt="Tell a friend about this page" src="/~media/elements/TellAFriend/button3.gif"></a></div><!-- </hs:element92> --><!-- <hs:element94> --><div id="element94" style="position: absolute; top: 2074px; left: 770px; width: 266px; height: 161px; z-index: 26;"><div style="font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;"><font face="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" col